# The JSON fields of every stored kind (the v1alpha1 runtime kinds and cmd/factory's
# internalKinds), at store.ReadableSchema below. A change here needs a ReadableSchema bump
# first (expand-then-write, internal/store/schema.go), then:
#   go test ./cmd/factory -run TestStoredSchema -update
readableSchema 1
